  m_Name: Glasshouse Cell Config 2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  CellName: Glasshouse
  Description: 'Allotment - intensity 2 of Glasshouse: three seeds and more grazers - a garden left
    alone starts to thin. The standard 1200 u cell with its nucleus (~392 u). No environment
    and NOTHING planted wild - every plant is an Angler''s seed, cacti at 1.4x leaf, up to
    30 plants between every colour (160 prisms, ~32,928 volume each at maturity). 9 tameable
    tadpoles graze every garden outside the nucleus; 3 omni crystals respawn inside it (the
    scene''s CrystalManager). Frenzy sits 25% above the full arena (6,857 prisms, 1,157,554
    volume). Authored by Tools/Build/author_glasshouse_assets.py - re-run it rather than
    hand-editing.'
